{"kind": "mod", "id": 2060, "name": "Secure Mapbook", "slug": "secure-mapbook", "teaser": "This mod introduces a secure, organized mapbook that stores all in-game maps.", "owner_name": "MrVibesRSA", "downloads": 8595, "favourites": 9, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": true, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.mrvibesrsa.securemapbook", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Items", "category_id": 4, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T06:34:13.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-03-25T17:48:21.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-03-25T17:48:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.0", "latest_version": "1.5.6", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<h1>Secure Mapbook Mod</h1>\n<p>“Your tactical cartography solution for SPT”</p>\n<h2>Description</h2>\n<p>A revolutionary storage solution that organizes all Tarkov maps into a single, secure book while preventing insurance exploitation. Designed for realism-focused players who want:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Logical map storage (No more loose maps cluttering stash)</li>\n<li>Tactical flexibility (Fits in secure containers AND Special Slots)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Built using Jehree’s Gilded Key Storage concept and optimized for use with Dynamic Maps.</p>\n<h2>Key Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>All-in-One Storage</strong>: Holds every map (1x2 slot) including Dynamic Maps content</li>\n<li><strong>Pocket-Friendly</strong>: Book + maps fit in secure containers and special slots</li>\n<li><strong>Organizational Pouch Compatible</strong>: Can be stored in SICC pouches and document cases</li>\n<li><strong>Trader Integration</strong>: Available from Prapor LL2</li>\n<li><strong>Fully Configurable</strong>: Adjust price, trader, and restrictions via config.json</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Recommended</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Dynamic Maps</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Credits &amp; Thanks</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SPT Team</strong> for the amazing modding platform</li>\n<li><strong>Jehre</strong> for the Gilded Key Storage concept</li>\n<li><strong>Dynamic Maps Developer</strong> mpstark for expanding Tarkov’s cartography</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Accessibility Note</h2>\n<p>This mod was developed with the assistance of AI tools to help with spelling, grammar, and readability due to the developer’s dyslexia.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 676, "published_at": "2025-05-15T12:47:51.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2060/secure-mapbook/1.0.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.5.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 9083619, "downloads": 489, "published_at": "2025-10-13T14:55:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2060/secure-mapbook/1.5.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.4", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 541, "published_at": "2025-10-16T18:38:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2060/secure-mapbook/1.0.4", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.5.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 9083690, "downloads": 284, "published_at": "2025-10-18T09:17:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2060/secure-mapbook/1.5.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.5.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 9083831, "downloads": 379, "published_at": "2025-10-20T07:13:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2060/secure-ma